  "selected_alignment_score_max": 0.545714,
  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Wellington is said to have chosen his officers by their noses and chins.",
      "output_sha256": "495ed42b76ef92e932fe53ed00f8e868941c49c196e4d374f86a8d0e6ce17d45",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "495ed42b76ef92e932fe53ed00f8e868941c49c196e4d374f86a8d0e6ce17d45",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The standard for them in noses must have been rather high, to judge by the portraits of the Duke, but no doubt he made allowances.",
      "output_sha256": "3ee566f4638af71a52aa73491bdb6a3f8e6d0f028a7392ad30dfa477a9d4843c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "3ee566f4638af71a52aa73491bdb6a3f8e6d0f028a7392ad30dfa477a9d4843c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Regardless, this peculiar method allowed him to assemble the men he deemed suitable.",
      "output_sha256": "69395c7dec18a1ac6db2e609f5bc6094e043069f2aaffdbc71699561bd1eac24",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.399498,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "19dce4f7794760da7e70fe4cc7ec51595394d81322f322e9bcabeeed570f5e1d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "69395c7dec18a1ac6db2e609f5bc6094e043069f2aaffdbc71699561bd1eac24",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Some people, however, may think that he would have done better to have let the mouth be the deciding test.",
      "output_sha256": "00161c818242e0af140d13c90374abcf7857ba4c59dfe5bb4fbf71fd5b100d09",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "00161c818242e0af140d13c90374abcf7857ba4c59dfe5bb4fbf71fd5b100d09",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The lines of one's nose are more or less arranged for one at birth.",
      "output_sha256": "6189d59f99cd2bcfae4889be8f8b00231fb8944ac4767bde2aa9e961737f1362",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "6189d59f99cd2bcfae4889be8f8b00231fb8944ac4767bde2aa9e961737f1362",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A baby, born with a snub nose, would feel it hard that the decision that he would be no use to Wellington should be come to so early.",
      "output_sha256": "2099a0812a08da2acf82b18998ef7365c2b0bbb17f8d4d5e4dee5ab17247fd6f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "2099a0812a08da2acf82b18998ef7365c2b0bbb17f8d4d5e4dee5ab17247fd6f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Conversely, a child with a more prominent nose could just as easily suffer an accident that would alter it, thereby jeopardizing any future military aspirations.",
      "output_sha256": "ff50a1551e9eb5934c0f05e73ea538bb3f8b3fe95f382ee5fe91a02db8df5e24",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.293152,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9b44c925a9699debad3088d123f69dacf276b228ddf46ac585b2635e2068cb4c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ff50a1551e9eb5934c0f05e73ea538bb3f8b3fe95f382ee5fe91a02db8df5e24",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "This, I think you will agree with me, would be unfair.",
      "output_sha256": "a3ea8c04bbf1bd51b7584e5c43a75c7b066ef8eaa1b92b4c3c49c9c78cae5fc5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "a3ea8c04bbf1bd51b7584e5c43a75c7b066ef8eaa1b92b4c3c49c9c78cae5fc5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In contrast, the mouth offers a far more reliable reflection of one's character.",
      "output_sha256": "98e3a9442754a284dd3bb1bca5e94771b4314afd323900f5c29b86ec034ea06d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.416667,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7b2670c7ee46729082e7635c59c30f64b0586b2693e0abec1c5ed9a46a22429d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "98e3a9442754a284dd3bb1bca5e94771b4314afd323900f5c29b86ec034ea06d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A man may clench his teeth firmly or smile disdainfully or sneer, or do a hundred things which will be reflected in his mouth rather than in his nose or chin.",
      "output_sha256": "1680581ed8ee9797e5a0650a0af23ef63ce02b8ec6062324aaf4fb2999e9189c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "1680581ed8ee9797e5a0650a0af23ef63ce02b8ec6062324aaf4fb2999e9189c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Emotions are primarily conveyed through the mouth and eyes, and thus one would expect these areas to bear the traces of our feelings.",
      "output_sha256": "ce427907ef278e392f1275a0874297d1657a03de021e2b0b84e06b614cc96bef",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.43172,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "686a498666981364fa6aeb8ed47b5045a636b9bb94e6277af97ad1b821ecc0be"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ce427907ef278e392f1275a0874297d1657a03de021e2b0b84e06b614cc96bef",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I did read once of a man whose nose quivered with rage, but it is not usual; I never heard of anyone whose chin did anything.",
      "output_sha256": "d7cc1a1da931f2fed47a861025d382f783e6a4b23025181ec62d19b39e0f1788",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "d7cc1a1da931f2fed47a861025d382f783e6a4b23025181ec62d19b39e0f1788",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It would be quite absurd to anticipate such a thing.",
      "output_sha256": "d267c98d8d240b99a9a036b70083b0b3067bccdacaf14fbe062de11c5a45daef",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.545714,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c356835a2e0abaf5877e71ea875e160acf2d5e61031cb83680e918da942383fa"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d267c98d8d240b99a9a036b70083b0b3067bccdacaf14fbe062de11c5a45daef",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But there arises now the objection that a man may conceal his mouth, and by that his character, with a moustache.",
      "output_sha256": "051e6ddd29f93728282f72089ffed1553ea92b237f8b7d0f4822becdd3c6cc87",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "051e6ddd29f93728282f72089ffed1553ea92b237f8b7d0f4822becdd3c6cc87",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There arises, too, the objection that a person whom you thought was a fool, because he always went about with his mouth open, may only have had a bad cold in the head.",
      "output_sha256": "45e7a1ed53a332d515e1880f225a086a3f7557947a9478a3c9bd8815fa401861",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "45e7a1ed53a332d515e1880f225a086a3f7557947a9478a3c9bd8815fa401861",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In fact the difficulties of telling anyone's character by his face seem more insuperable every moment.",
      "output_sha256": "03cc5c77d18fc8586b91996401c73d2673a8b0272596ab4c50526d548690b78d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "03cc5c77d18fc8586b91996401c73d2673a8b0272596ab4c50526d548690b78d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "How, then, are we to tell whether we may safely trust a man with our daughter, or our favourite golf club, or whatever we hold most dear?",
      "output_sha256": "1aeedc5c8de106cdc84a12a393a2db10c228d7423f000724fd37c27cab3b63e7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "1aeedc5c8de106cdc84a12a393a2db10c228d7423f000724fd37c27cab3b63e7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Fortunately a benefactor has stepped in at the right moment with an article on the cigar-manner.",
      "output_sha256": "c31407b2e2814968e87114ef76bd3e93a1877047f761bee8f7f266faed1cfb07",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "c31407b2e2814968e87114ef76bd3e93a1877047f761bee8f7f266faed1cfb07",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Our gentleman has made the discovery that you can tell a man's nature by the way he handles his cigar, and he gives a dozen illustrations to explain his theory.",
      "output_sha256": "f4785fc9f6d7c0685163337d691dc9b0f5b75863619ddeeb0ab103e3bf6cc3e7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "f4785fc9f6d7c0685163337d691dc9b0f5b75863619ddeeb0ab103e3bf6cc3e7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "True, this leaves out of account the men who don't smoke cigars; although, of course, you might sum them all up, with a certain amount of justification, as foolish.",
      "output_sha256": "985c20a086c8b8ced8b0e9283f3b0c338afa1b2d86fcfeb0599aac825b56afc7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "985c20a086c8b8ced8b0e9283f3b0c338afa1b2d86fcfeb0599aac825b56afc7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But you do get, I am assured, a very important index to the characters of smokers— which is as much as to say of the people who really count.",
      "output_sha256": "19bc9e0e944bf908980cc8a6a7e5ba40b8c146755f8ce0fa6c25b701ff33701f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "19bc9e0e944bf908980cc8a6a7e5ba40b8c146755f8ce0fa6c25b701ff33701f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I won’t divulge all the specifics of this theory just yet; for one, I risk infringing on someone else's intellectual property, and secondly, I’ve unfortunately forgotten many of the details.",
      "output_sha256": "e00422a3251239482d1f1fa1a8206cca56d7dc0dbc705374057f3661f22fb9ff",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.33477,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cc2608ee27454fa5241cc88734b51a369a75330181426bb8f90d5149220b95b1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e00422a3251239482d1f1fa1a8206cca56d7dc0dbc705374057f3661f22fb9ff",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But the idea roughly is that if a man holds his cigar between his finger and thumb, he is courageous and kind to animals (or whatever it may be), and if he holds it between his first and second fingers he is impulsive but yet considerate to old ladies, and if he holds it upside down he is (besides being an ass) jealous and self-assertive, and if he sticks a knife into the stump so as to smoke it to the very end he is— yes, you have guessed this one—he is mean.",
      "output_sha256": "e093013c0912822e0e6181f5e15061b966e3925040b70239619cd76ce10e9c8c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "e093013c0912822e0e6181f5e15061b966e3925040b70239619cd76ce10e9c8c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "One can see how a simple cigar might provide such useful insights.",
      "output_sha256": "79c9859f6a126c526dc3dd4f2c69e7810739655b0f05e6c3cf33b9e8d3613ac0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.35368,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "27aff616e7919faa44f24ba52b97441c44dac79d8899075b3c0c741d64d3c8a4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "79c9859f6a126c526dc3dd4f2c69e7810739655b0f05e6c3cf33b9e8d3613ac0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Reflecting on this theory, I find myself regretting its introduction to the public sphere.",
      "output_sha256": "34318a0ecee31a07da85d7770aa42704ea67f838d9a0e389868d96aeeca6317b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.332233,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1bd6b3560f407a8c3e65a5fac43965c546061a65e64f66bb6677affc35590f7c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "34318a0ecee31a07da85d7770aa42704ea67f838d9a0e389868d96aeeca6317b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Yes; I blame myself for giving it further publicity.",
      "output_sha256": "9c83600c86c7b7d83c70708238e70b8a0f2e9fb1d222e28b114ec94d16333a88",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "9c83600c86c7b7d83c70708238e70b8a0f2e9fb1d222e28b114ec94d16333a88",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In days gone by, when we received a cigar as a gift or purchased one, our only concern would be whether it was of good quality.",
      "output_sha256": "8c82be09edaf587c02917912a99f8871806bd7049f3157726d12747d4a099b30",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.481937,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5484f99123e44578369fd18c6f67752ebb177a163409d62f5abfb26761f08cd0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8c82be09edaf587c02917912a99f8871806bd7049f3157726d12747d4a099b30",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "We would merely bite one end, light the other, and proceed to enjoy it without a second thought.",
      "output_sha256": "1cd69c7a221f56b030a69f1fac1ff0bfe7ad8e2de2e3a43d6430d9a7aa37f940",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.494068,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c9fb39ec5897b579fa4023e5adcdc03fe9d822c8769b94e27d668bfe95eeb56b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1cd69c7a221f56b030a69f1fac1ff0bfe7ad8e2de2e3a43d6430d9a7aa37f940",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But all this will be changed now.",
      "output_sha256": "1f5a91856019698a5f0829ec4ceb4c59a3324b203c32da3a20db29364d38e4b2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "1f5a91856019698a5f0829ec4ceb4c59a3324b203c32da3a20db29364d38e4b2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We shall be horribly self- conscious.",
      "output_sha256": "8e0d4b64d9425738d729cd0bde7df06a929c3c6d86a1feb639363bb41adfb6f5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "8e0d4b64d9425738d729cd0bde7df06a929c3c6d86a1feb639363bb41adfb6f5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "When we take our cigars from our mouths we shall feel our neighbours' eyes rooted upon our hands, the while we try to remember which of all the possible manipulations is the one which represents virtue at its highest power.",
      "output_sha256": "093f20b0b0c941ce669826015ab4abd602f8b9dff1b11b2bcc756652a4f7a89e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "093f20b0b0c941ce669826015ab4abd602f8b9dff1b11b2bcc756652a4f7a89e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Speaking for myself, I hold my cigar in a dozen different ways during an evening (though never, of course, on the end of a knife), and I tremble to think of the diabolically composite nature which the modern Wellingtons of the table must attribute to me.",
      "output_sha256": "b164a706c99743644c6656cd481744cf771d737a2982d3d0d8bc0841672ea69e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "b164a706c99743644c6656cd481744cf771d737a2982d3d0d8bc0841672ea69e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Moving forward, I see the necessity of settling on a single method.",
      "output_sha256": "8a42f3667240d9633a577b5a57515d6b4a8eaba62797c362b2e0a486fe11f857",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.394401,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d62f0cbc205b40716da697164c222c8fdc863de6df27b316e6bf3703ce140309"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8a42f3667240d9633a577b5a57515d6b4a8eaba62797c362b2e0a486fe11f857",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If only I could remember the one which shows me at my best!",
      "output_sha256": "c05a8dd5d5cdb5cf3189559e7fb75f0d7424f1d1ba1188a59dfc01b6caa95d7e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "c05a8dd5d5cdb5cf3189559e7fb75f0d7424f1d1ba1188a59dfc01b6caa95d7e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But the tobacco test is not the only one.",
      "output_sha256": "ca9c8f75dac94d9ddab2508a32f64279644ffa28411dde7a1e3b7b2c4e725763",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "ca9c8f75dac94d9ddab2508a32f64279644ffa28411dde7a1e3b7b2c4e725763",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We may be told by the way we close our hands; the tilt of a walking-stick may unmask us.",
      "output_sha256": "b9194bb732638a74e580d662b50c1d344ce199cddf2a44e6379c953f920a21e9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "b9194bb732638a74e580d662b50c1d344ce199cddf2a44e6379c953f920a21e9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is useless to model ourselves now on the strong, silent man of the novel whose face is a shutter to hide his emotions.",
      "output_sha256": "7183374f06c33574fc8ebcf8aeb9accf668a086a1e455b09c0b49207d0a88dbf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "7183374f06c33574fc8ebcf8aeb9accf668a086a1e455b09c0b49207d0a88dbf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "This is a pity; yes, I am convinced now that it is a pity.",
      "output_sha256": "1324aa601491a67862354935c42486aef2518732e21274ff7f29cdb6818b6560",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "1324aa601491a67862354935c42486aef2518732e21274ff7f29cdb6818b6560",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If my secret fault is cheque-forging I do not want it to be revealed to the world by the angle of my hat; still less do I wish to discover it in a friend whom I like or whom I can beat at billiards.",
      "output_sha256": "559ffe82e97ddd36f4e598a67790bb739fb892338a234e37435f2f0fb0578ab4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "559ffe82e97ddd36f4e598a67790bb739fb892338a234e37435f2f0fb0578ab4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Imagine how mundane life would become if we could instantly understand every acquaintance's character simply by offering them a cigar.",
      "output_sha256": "4a9573a7a8542d82a40e58e4255935c94adefa7705aea8f6e5a102622b2b26e9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": 0.324961,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "817cd52e074e5b48d4dc0176f86f48c2eb635494f496e337b5aa5406cd218be3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4a9573a7a8542d82a40e58e4255935c94adefa7705aea8f6e5a102622b2b26e9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Take an extreme example: what if a charming young bachelor, who admires our bowling prowess, revealed himself through his shoelaces to be a secret wife-beater?",
      "output_sha256": "844187d84ff5c02e607a9b94180a0c1b4ce7f180868145f7a315c7eff59bff9d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.520788,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ca9c562e5da050984d81b40a36de4dcbae00537ab49b4f149e1d3fedd219e5a8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "844187d84ff5c02e607a9b94180a0c1b4ce7f180868145f7a315c7eff59bff9d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "What could we do?",
      "output_sha256": "abccf78f9acefc0c4bca2ac7c4c4f068e0cf84d5e4392481d4c1f01658123657",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "abccf78f9acefc0c4bca2ac7c4c4f068e0cf84d5e4392481d4c1f01658123657",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Cut so unique a friend?",
      "output_sha256": "f9d1319867ccc066b85d7b547f7d42035f3209593fe5871132a173fb3a00caae",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "f9d1319867ccc066b85d7b547f7d42035f3209593fe5871132a173fb3a00caae",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Certainly not.",
      "output_sha256": "52ad61598f19718c49ab7b0951d95bf9e3296810e056ce0c7bf0a1cc073636ce",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.432199,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44,
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d2804f49cf89d3a4c08e06b6eba7a37f4943a59d065aebbccbfd05e8364bf010",
        "1b43f6cc395127ea9d19bf0988957786ca33fa6917dcba07ccae71ad87dbe4e6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "52ad61598f19718c49ab7b0951d95bf9e3296810e056ce0c7bf0a1cc073636ce",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44,
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Let us hope to remain blissfully unaware of the flaws of those we care about, just as we wish for them to remain ignorant of our own shortcomings.",
      "output_sha256": "9a50fd050e1b7cc7773260f7db39c2ea094a04345b385f2a802d8b71c8117adf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.432199,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
